<title>FRANCE: Chargeurs Intl 1997 Q1 sales fall.</title>
<headline>Chargeurs Intl 1997 Q1 sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 2,154    vs    2,253</p>
<p>NOTE - Chargeurs International reported its first-quarter sales in the official bulletin BALO. It said they were down 4.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
